sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant FE as Frontend
  participant GW as Gateway
  participant CH as chat-service
  participant HB as habits-service
  participant AI as AI provider

  U->>FE: Types a message
  FE->>GW: POST /api/chat/conversations/:id/messages
  GW->>GW: Verify JWT, apply rate limit
  GW->>CH: Forward request (SSE)
  CH->>CH: Validate, store user message, screen for crisis language
  opt "Use my habit data" enabled
    CH->>HB: GET /internal/users/:id/summary
    HB-->>CH: 7-day averages, streak
  end
  CH->>AI: Stream request (system prompt + recent history)
  loop For each text chunk
    AI-->>CH: delta
    CH-->>FE: event: delta
    FE-->>U: Reply grows in place
  end
  CH->>CH: Store assistant message
  CH-->>FE: event: done
